#. module: website_hr_recruitment_livechat
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_website_hr_recruitment_livechat
msgid ""
"\n"
"A chatbot to help the user be guided through recruitment process on the "
"website and land on the right jobs position.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ແຊັດບອດເພື່ອຊ່ວຍແນະນຳຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນຂະບວນການຮັບສະໝັກວຽກຢູ່ໃນເວັບໄຊ ແລະ ຊອກຫາຕຳແໜ່ງງານທີ່ເໝາະສົມ.\n"

#. module: website_hr_recruitment_livechat
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_website_hr_recruitment_livechat
msgid "Chatbot for the HR Recruitment"
msgstr "ແຊັດບອດສຳລັບການຮັບສະໝັກວຽກ HR"

#. module: website_hr_recruitment_livechat
#: model_terms:chatbot.script.step,message:website_hr_recruitment_livechat.chatbot_script_website_hr_recruitment_rd_chat_hr
#: model_terms:chatbot.script.step,message:website_hr_recruitment_livechat.chatbot_script_website_hr_recruitment_sales_chat_hr
#: model_terms:chatbot.script.step,message:website_hr_recruitment_livechat.chatbot_script_website_hr_recruitment_service_community_chat_hr
#: model_terms:chatbot.script.step,message:website_hr_recruitment_livechat.chatbot_script_website_hr_recruitment_services_consultant_chat_hr
msgid "Do you want to chat with one of our HR about this job?"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການສົນທະນາກັບພະນັກງານ HR ຂອງພວກເຮົາກ່ຽວກັບວຽກນີ້ບໍ່?"

#. module: website_hr_recruitment_livechat
#: model_terms:chatbot.script.step,message:website_hr_recruitment_livechat.chatbot_script_website_hr_recruitment_welcome
msgid "Hello, can I help you find the perfect job?"
msgstr "ສະບາຍດີ, ໃຫ້ຂ້ອຍຊ່ວຍເຈົ້າຊອກຫາວຽກທີ່ເໝາະສົມໄດ້ບໍ່?"

#. module: website_hr_recruitment_livechat
#: model_terms:chatbot.script.step,message:website_hr_recruitment_livechat.chatbot_script_website_hr_recruitment_rd_noon_available
#: model_terms:chatbot.script.step,message:website_hr_recruitment_livechat.chatbot_script_website_hr_recruitment_sales_noon_available
#: model_terms:chatbot.script.step,message:website_hr_recruitment_livechat.chatbot_script_website_hr_recruitment_services_community_noon_available
#: model_terms:chatbot.script.step,message:website_hr_recruitment_livechat.chatbot_script_website_hr_recruitment_services_consultant_noon_available
msgid "Hu-ho, it looks like none of our operators are available 🙁"
msgstr "ໂອ້, ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຕອນນີ້ບໍ່ມີເຈົ້າໜ້າທີ່ໃດຫວ່າງເລີຍ 🙁"

