msgstr "ເຈົ້າກຳລັງຊອກຫາຫຍັງໃນພະແນກບໍລິການ?"

#. module: website_hr_recruitment_livechat
#: model_terms:chatbot.script.step,message:website_hr_recruitment_livechat.chatbot_script_website_hr_recruitment_department
