"Would you mind leaving your email address so that we can reach you back?"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສະດວກຝາກທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວໄວ້ບໍ່ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ກັບໄດ້?"

#. module: website_hr_recruitment_livechat
#: model:chatbot.script.answer,name:website_hr_recruitment_livechat.chatbot_script_website_hr_recruitment_rd_chat_hr_yes
#: model:chatbot.script.answer,name:website_hr_recruitment_livechat.chatbot_script_website_hr_recruitment_sales_chat_hr_yes
#: model:chatbot.script.answer,name:website_hr_recruitment_livechat.chatbot_script_website_hr_recruitment_services_community_chat_hr_yes
#: model:chatbot.script.answer,name:website_hr_recruitment_livechat.chatbot_script_website_hr_recruitment_services_consultant_chat_hr_yes
